# ── Build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────
/bin/
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# ── Go ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
/vendor/
go.work.sum

# Generated protobuf code IS committed, deliberately.
#
# It used to be ignored, with `make proto` as the instruction. The consequence
# only became visible when something built from a clean tree for the first
# time: core and all three gateways import pkg/pb, so a fresh clone could not
# build them at all — and `buf generate` reaches buf.build for its plugins, so
# the fix was not local either. A clone now builds with nothing but a Go
# toolchain. .github/workflows/proto.yml fails the build if what is committed
# stops matching proto/.

# ── Test output ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.test
coverage.out
coverage.txt
coverage.html

# ── Local state and secrets ──────────────────────────────
#
# .certpilot/ holds development mTLS material — including CA, gateway, and core
# private keys — and persisted ACME account keys. None of it belongs in version
# control, and an account key in a public repository lets anyone act as your
# ACME account.
.certpilot/

# Key encryption keys, certificates, and anything else key-shaped.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
!deploy/**/*.example.pem

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
config.dev.yaml
config.yaml

# ── Frontend ─────────────────────────────────────────────
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

# ── Tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignored by contents rather than as a directory: git does not descend into an
# ignored directory, so a negation inside one never takes effect.
#
# The exception is this project's own skill. It is the working knowledge of the
# codebase — how to run it, how to verify it, and the defects that shaped its
# invariants — and it is only worth writing if it reaches whoever works here
# next. Everything else under .claude/ is a local collection of unrelated skills.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/certpilot-dev/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Docker ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.docker/

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
skills-lock.json
.verify-work/

# Working directory for scripts/gateway-compatibility.sh: a built core, a
# development PKI and the gateway binaries it installs to talk to.
.compat/

# Working directory for scripts/agent-lifecycle.sh. Holds an enrolled agent's
# identity key and the certificate it was issued, so it is ignored for the same
# reason .certpilot/ is and not merely because it is build output.
.agentlife/
__pycache__/
